Dockerfile.explained

# This image only builds apps/frontend. Exclude AWS CDK infra source (and any
# cdk.out/cdk.context.json cache) from the build context entirely — the only
# thing the deps stage needs from apps/backend is its package.json, for
# `npm ci` to validate the workspace lockfile against every member.
apps/backend/**
!apps/backend/package.json